# SmartVend — example environment file.
# Copy to `.env` and fill in real values. NEVER commit `.env`, and NEVER
# paste these keys into an AI agent chat (seminar rule: protect secrets).
#
# The UI itself needs NO secrets — it talks to the ESP32 over the local
# SoftAP. These are only for optional backend/build tooling.

# SMS gateway fallback (if you ever proxy SIM800L via a cloud SMS API)
SMS_API_KEY=

# Admin password is stored HASHED on the SD card by the firmware — not here.
